Eternals and Shang-chi,

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:11.257
both on Disney Plus now,
little plug for you.

00:00:11.257 --> 00:00:13.970
And we both grew up loving all
superheroes and comic books

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:14.803
and in movies.

00:00:14.803 --> 00:00:17.350
So it's time for a game
that tests how well

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.190
