00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.010
Now in this game, we're gonna find out

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.660
who knows their fellow superheroes better.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.500
Now what I'm gonna do is
describe a super power

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.280
and if you know the
superhero with that power

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.250
